  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ながい　たいもうのしたに　かくした　ツタをきように　あやつりかたい　つぼみを　てきに　たたきつける。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "긴 털 아래 숨긴 덩굴을 능숙하게 다뤄서 단단한 꽃봉오리로 상대를 가격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會靈巧操控長長的體毛下隱藏的藤蔓，將堅硬的花苞甩向敵人猛打。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il manie avec habileté la liane dissimulée sous ses longs poils et frappe ses adversaires avec le bourgeon dur situé à son extrémité.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lenkt geschickt die Ranke, die es unter seinem langen Fell verbirgt, und schleudert die harte Knospe an ihrem Ende auf Gegner.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Maneja diestramente la vid oculta bajo su largo pelaje y propina latigazos al enemigo con el capullo endurecido de la punta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Muove con agilità la liana nascosta sotto il lungo pelo e sferza il nemico con il duro bocciolo sulla punta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Floragato deftly wields the vine hidden beneath its long fur, slamming the hard flower bud against its opponents.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "長い　体毛の下に　隠した　ツタを器用に　操り硬い　つぼみを　敵に　叩きつける。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "灵巧地操控长长的体毛下隐藏着的藤蔓，接着把坚硬的花苞甩向敌人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Maneja diestramente la vid oculta bajo su largo pelaje y propina latigazos al enemigo con el capullo endurecido de la punta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいもうの　かたさは　きぶんで　かわる。りんせんたいせいになるとハリのように　えいりに　とがるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "털의 강도는 기분에 따라 변한다. 전투태세에 들어가면 바늘처럼 예리하고 뾰족해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "體毛的硬度會隨心情而變。進入迎戰狀態時，體毛會變得如針般尖銳。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La rigidité de ses poils dépend de son état d’esprit. Quand il se prépare au combat, ceux-ci se hérissent et sont acérés comme des aiguilles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Geschmeidigkeit seines Fells ändert sich je nach Laune des Pokémon. Macht es sich für den Kampf bereit, wird das Fell so spitz wie Nadeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La dureza de su pelaje cambia según su estado de ánimo. Cuando se prepara para combatir, se vuelve duro y punzante como agujas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La durezza della pelliccia cambia in base al suo stato d’animo. Quando si accinge alla lotta, il suo pelo diventa irto di punte acuminate come aghi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The hardness of Floragato’s fur depends on the Pokémon’s mood. When Floragato is prepared to battle, its fur becomes pointed and needle sharp.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体毛の　硬さは　気分で　変わる。臨戦態勢になると針のように　鋭利に　尖るぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
